## Interface: 11504, 16001
## Title: pH
## Notes: Session-based gold-per-hour tracking with double-ledger accounting. Features minimize/maximize HUD, real-time metrics, and conservative item valuation (WoW Classic Anniversary, WoW Forever)
## Author: Claude Code
## Version: 1.6.0
## SavedVariables: pH_DB_Account
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: pH_DB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: pH_Settings

